4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:25,000
We solemnly declare:

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,500
Side by side we stand

6
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:35,500
Islands of the blue Caribbean sea,

7
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:40,000
